@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor "Guest" as Guest
participant "RegistrationView\n(UI)" as UI
participant "UserService\n(Backend)" as Service
participant "UserRepository\n(DB)" as DB

Guest -> UI : Input details & click Register
UI -> Service : registerUser(user)
activate Service

Service -> DB : existsByUsername(user.getUsername())
activate DB
DB --> Service : return boolean (true/false)
deactivate DB

Note over Service: If false, encrypt password\nand prepare profile

Service -> DB : save(user)
activate DB
DB --> Service : return saved User document
deactivate DB

Service --> UI : return success / throw Exception
deactivate Service

UI -> Guest : Show notification & navigate to LoginView
@enduml